#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0288 expect=skipped domain=TS
#note "NO #library line at all: get_codelist_attributes carries the LIBRARY provider capability, so the rule SKIPs (Rule skipped - no Library access) before any row is read -- never a PASS. Before wave 0 the declared GET_CODELIST_ATTRIBUTES operation earned this through its OperationType; the function earns it through its descriptor (PLAN-binding-expressions provider capability, arm a). Precedent: CDISC-CG0001-skipped_no_library-LB.cdt."
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVCDREF type=Char
col TSVCDVER type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
